sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P as You
  participant S as Skill in your client
  participant C as wl core
  S->>C: begin the step
  C-->>S: what exists, open questions, your repository's guidance
  S->>P: preflight: plan, limits, how to stop, plus questions
  P-->>S: answers
  Note over S: the work: research, writing, building, reviewing
  S->>C: complete the step with its artifact
  C-->>S: checked, recorded, what can come next
  S->>P: receipt, and your decision when one is due
